window.products.push({"id":655103,"name":"Trademark Games 72-CB340 Toy Gun Alarm Clock Game, 3.875x7.875x7, White/Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FLKybWLlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Jump into the day like a bullet from a gun or earn a precious five extra minutes of sleep by proving your accuracy with a gun, with the Trademark Games Toy Gun and Target Recordable Alarm Clock, you get to pick how your morning starts. Simple and fun, this alarm clock is a great gift for just about anyone! Simply set the 12 hour digital clock to your desired wake up time, record your favorite song or a personalized alarm to wake up to, and then you’re ready for a great nights sleep! When the alarm sounds in the morning, aim and fire at the target to earn 5 more minutes of sleep! Two difficulties: Normal (one bullseye shot) and Hard (FIVE bullseyes). Practice your aim during the day with one of two game modes: Reaction Tester and Accuracy Tester! SATISFACTION GUARANTEED- Trademark Games is committed to providing the consumer with the absolute best price and value on all of our products, which we ensure by applying a rigorous quality control process. NOTE: This is an exclusive product of Trademark Games and ONLY TOY GUN ALARM CLOCK by Trademark Games are GUARANTEED to be genuine IMPORTANT:  Avoid buying counterfeit products and transacting with unauthorized sellers.  Look for our logo on the packaging for every one of our products. Trademark Games is a registered trademark protected by U.S. Trademark law and will be vigorously defended. From the Manufacturer Tough time getting out of bed in the morning? Ever feel like shooting your alarm clock for a few more minutes of precious sleep? Now you can start the day with a bang with the Gun and Target Recordable Alarm Clock from Trademark Games.This revolutionary alarm clock will improve the caliber of your sleep by going into snooze mode when you shoot the target with the included gun. Simply set the 12 hour clock and alarm for your desired wake time, record your own wake up message or music and enjoy a great night’s sleep. When it’s time to wake up your recording will play for three minutes and the target will pop up. Shoot the bull’s-eye once in normal mode or five times in hard mode with the gun for another five minutes of sleep. Press and hold the ‘M’ button to turn off the alarm and return to regular mode.In addition to the alarm modes the Gun and Target Recordable Alarm Clock by TG also includes two game modes: reaction tester and accuracy tester.The Gun and Target Recordable Alarm Clock by TG is a fun effective alternative to the daily routine. Blast your way out of bed in the morning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FLKybWLlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Games","source_asin":"B004PHQBSE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-655103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004PHQBSE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004PHQBSE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
