window.products.push({"id":655311,"name":"Silky Soft Faux Fur Rug, 5 ft. x 7 ft. Ivory Fluffy Rug, Made in France, Sheepskin Area Rug, Shaggy Rug for Living Room, Bedroom, Kid's Room, or Nurse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81haZv0-uaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft, Plush Comfort You Can Depend On. Walk On Me Rugs are knitted in the traditional manner using only faux fur. Each rug is made using high-quality materials, never unraveling because they are machine knitted and not tufted. No animal fur is ever used. For easy care, you can machine wash in cold water, but since the dirt simply sits on the surface, all they need is a good shaking. With the Integrated Latex Non-Slip Backing there is no need to spend money on a separate non-slip rug pad. Ultra-Soft, Like Genuine Sheepskin or Fur but Without the Guilt. This Walk On Me Faux Fur Sheepskin Area Rug boasts a soft, plush surface to furnish a warm feeling every time you place your feet on it. It’s gentle against your skin and luxuriously comfortable between your toes. The ultra-soft, acrylic rug is an excellent way to transform your living space and add a touch of charm to your home decor. Rich, Luxurious Ambiance. Pull a room's decor together with an elegant, inviting look. Regardless of whether you’re trying to provide a cradled space for your little ones or add an elegant touch to your living room, bedroom, office or den, you can relish the finer things in life. This sheepskin area rug is ultra-durable and machine washable with a no-slip, latex / rubber backing, making it suitable for high-traffic areas in any interior space. To accommodate everyone’s taste, this rug is available in five different sizes to best suit your living space. Own a faux fur sheepskin rug today by clicking Add to Cart.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81haZv0-uaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Walk on Me","source_asin":"B0BS138M22","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-655311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS138M22","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS138M22","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":655312,"name":"HOSPITOLOGY PRODUCTS Box Spring Encasement - Zippered Bed Bug Dust Mite Proof Hypoallergenic - Sleep Defense System - Split King - 39\" W x 80\" L - Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C3YTchFPL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"Your bed is an expensive investment-why not protect it? The Sleep Defense System by HOSPITOLOGY PRODUCTS brings Hotel and Healthcare caliber bedding protection to your home. Featuring extra-tough seam construction and high thread-count polyester knit fabric. Ultra-plush knit fabric is soft to the touch. Fully breathable-does not retain heat and is cool to sleep on. Mattress encasements are an effective tool to protect your mattress, and can help you sleep better by reducing common sources of respiratory disruption from reaching the sleeper. This encasement will accommodate a box spring height of 9\"-11”. It is Fully machine washable and dryable, or you may simply wipe it clean with a damp cloth. It is zippered on 3 sides and features an additional security measure to reduce the amount of substances and organisms from exiting the zipper. Our unique Zipper Lock system ensures that your box spring encasement remains secure and intact for the life of your mattress. Size: King (78\"x80\"). Fits Box Springs 8.5”-10” Deep. PLEASE NOTE: King packages are designed to accommodate Split Box Springs ONLY, and include 2 smaller encasements in each package. Machine washable, Tumble Dry Low or No Heat. Please follow all included care instructions to maintain your mattress encasement’s warranty. Contains no Vinyl, PVC, or Phthalates, or fabric treatments of any kind. Includes a 5-year limited manufacturer’s warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C3YTchFPL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOSPITOLOGY PRODUCTS","source_asin":"B0947GKNXT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-655312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0947GKNXT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0947GKNXT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
