window.products.push({"id":655473,"name":"Northern Brewer - Tall Boy HomeBrewing Stainless Steel Brew Kettle Stock Pot For Beer Brewing - (15 Gallon Capacity/60 Quarts)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VR2XTtWsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 15 Gallon Tall Boy is serious kettle for the brewer who wants the option to brew 5 or 10 gallon batches. The 15 gallon size allows plenty of space to boil 11-12 gallons of wort.  This kettle can also serve as a mash tun for 5 gallon all-grain brewers using the optional false bottom. Easily accommodates even the largest grain bills.  Ideal for: Boiling 11-12 gallons of wort.  A Brew Kettle of Epic Proportions!  This is no repurposed stock pot. The Tall Boy is made specifically for homebrewers. Brew scientists have determined that the ideal height to diameter ratio for a brew kettle should be 1.2:1 in order to optimize boil performance. The Tall Boy reduces evaporative losses, and less evaporative cooling means a more vigorous boil. A vigorous boil means more volatilization of off flavors, and better hop utilization. All of that means better beer. Add to that it’s 4mm thick tri-clad bottom, designed to stop bullets and prevent scorching, and you’ve got a serious brewer’s tool. The Tall Boy logo is laser etched into the surface as a subtle indication to the world that you take brewing seriously.  Approximate Dimensions: 13.3\" Wide by 16\" Tall","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VR2XTtWsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northern Brewer","source_asin":"B00XPVJHUU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-655473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XPVJHUU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XPVJHUU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
