window.products.push({"id":655604,"name":"5 Pcs linsencents Holder with 3 in 1 Blue Enamel Incense Burner ，The Incense Ash Brush and Two-Color Bump Design Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V6h2iECQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Blue enamel incense burner RELAXATION. CALMNESS. MEDITATION. ZEN. Exhaustion, confusion, anxiety, restlessness, Modern life is full of various negative emotions, In the noisy and busy journey of life, We really need to create a moment of tranquility for ourselves to release our tense spirit and pressure. You only need to light an incense stick and let the soft fragrance drift slowly in the air, At this point, make a good cup of tea or latte and find a comfortable position. Product Information Size: Blue enamel incense burner Ash catcher Diameter 3.5 inches, height 1.22 inches, weigh 2.12 ounces. Two-color aluminum dust catcher:diameter 4.72 inch Incense Ash Brush:length5.31inch x Please DO NOT use incense sticks that are too long, prevent the incense holder from overturning or the incense ash spilling outside the incense holder. How to clean: Rinse with water and dry with dry cloth. Specifications: Packing List: : 1 x Incense Sticks Holder, 1 x brass 9 holes incense holder for stick/cone incense, 1 x brass gourd-shaped incense holder for stick/coil incense.1 x Incense Ash Brush;1 x 4.72 inch alloy ash catcher, Color: Blue enamel incense burner Base: two-color (black + matte gold) It can create a peaceful atmosphere and purify the air, meditate and relax, relieve stress. Perfect for the living room, bedroom, study, meditation room, yoga room, temple, bathroom, etc. The incense burner holder also works as a decoration even without the incense. xThis beautiful lotus incense stick holder is inspired by the timeless beauty of lotus blossoms with significance of auspicious. This cute lotus incense burner is ideal for burning your favorite incenses while providing a relaxing touch to your home. -Gorgeous Incense Holder","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V6h2iECQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mzhang","source_asin":"B099RP5SFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-655604","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099RP5SFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099RP5SFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
