window.products.push({"id":655643,"name":"Thyself Insulated Coffee Mug with handle, 14 oz Stainless Steel Double Wall Vacuum Travel Cup with Flip Top Lid for Hot & Cold Drinks (Discover Seafoa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714V6W9IEAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your ideal travel companion and your bedtime reading partner - An all-in-one solution with ultimate fun, safety and comfort! What’s more pleasing than being able to have your coffee anytime, anywhere and just the way you like it? Sounds amazing, right? Well, it is possible now with Thyself Rambler 14 oz. coffee mug insulated and treated for maintaining just the right temperature for your beverage for long periods of time. The insulated mug with handle and lid is the perfect solution for you if you are tired of melted-iced tea, undesired lukewarm coffee or residual taste from your current beverage mug. It is your ideal travel companion that keeps your coffee or tea hot for 6 hours and cold for 12 hours. This convenience is attributed to the double-wall and vacuum-insulated body of the inspirational coffee mug with lid. The stainless steel coffee mug with handle is easy to carry and is perfect for personal development! It will hold the liquid that fuels your day, remind you to discover thyself, inspire you to live beyond your limits and unlock your true potential! And when we discover who we truly are, the opportunities are endless!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714V6W9IEAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thyself","source_asin":"B08SZQH4CS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-655643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SZQH4CS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SZQH4CS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":655644,"name":"Kobi Blocks Maple End Grain Butcher Block Wood Cutting Board 12\" x 16\" x 1.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710YOaAyKoL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your kitchen by adding a custom made Butcher Block Cutting Board. Easily one of our most popular blocks, you can’t go wrong with this old world styling and rustic charm. The block truly brings out the beauty in simplicity. Manufacturing Process All the wood used is purchased from a local mill here in the Smoky Mountains. All Tennessee Butcher Blocks are manufactured with precision machinery using all natural products to balance making your board unique, while maintaining the highest standards in each step of our planeing, ripping, adhesion, measuring, cutting, sanding and oiling processes. We are a husband and wife team and we make each order as they come in, ensuring that every board is fresh cut and newly crafted just for you! Design We strive to bring an artistic quality to every board we make so your piece can seamlessly fit in as a contemporary, yet rustic, homey and warm piece of décor when not in use. Is there a special occasion coming up in your life? Tennessee Butcher Blocks make the perfect gift for Mother’s or Father’s day, Valentine’s Day, Birthdays, Anniversaries, Weddings, Christmas, Hanukkah, Housewarming gifts and many other traditional occasions. Other sites can take weeks to get your board out; whereas we can get it to you in days! Since our boards are made from all natural healthy wood products, and not from chemically plagued plastic products, Tennessee Butcher Blocks require minimal, but needed maintenance to help keep your board in good condition. Our maintenance guide comes complimentary with every piece. Our Promise We stand behind our products and make every board to last a lifetime with proper maintenance for each and every Tennessee Butcher Block we sell, in hopes that your Block will be a part of your family and home for generations. Best of all; ALL Tennessee Butcher Blocks are 100% MADE IN THE USA!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710YOaAyKoL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kobi Blocks","source_asin":"B00LHCY7TK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-655644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LHCY7TK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LHCY7TK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
