window.products.push({"id":655715,"name":"Hyoank AsianTraditional Wok Pan, 12.4'' Woks and Stir Fry Pans, Carbon Steel Wok with Lid Suits for all Stoves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VxbPuoqPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What you get：12.4'' carbon steel wok pan, standable glass lid. They are vital for any Asian food lover or Asian eating establishment. Worry-free 12-month warranty, and friendly customer service. Durable and Healthy: The stir fry wok is made of carbon steel without chemical non-stick coating, that is sturdy and non-toxic. And cooking with iron wok can reduce the loss of nutrients in food, especially vegetables.This is an iron wok without chemical coating. It is normal for iron to rust, non toxic, no harm to health. Just make sure you wash it, dry it and oil it after every use and it should last for years. Detail Design: The wooden handle is detachable. When remove the handle, the wok can be used in oven. There is a ring on the handle for hanging storage and saving kitchen space. The design of the handle makes it easy to grab and the wooden material keep cooling for safety to touch. The pouring nozzle is convenient for pouring the soup into the dish. And the 12.5\" size is suitable for cooking dishes for 3-5 persons's family. Printed hammered texture is gorgeous and unique. All-match Wok: The carbon steel wok has no non-stick coating, so all kinds of spatulas can be used. And this is a flat bottom wok that makes it can be used on various stoves, such as electric, induction, gas, ceramic stoves, and oven(remove the handle). This wok gets hot quickly and stays hot for solid reliable stir-frying and oil frying. Also, the wok pan is multifunctional that can be used to stir-fry, steam, roast, boil, bake meals and more. One wok in hand, have varieties of cuisines. Standable Glass Lid: The material of this lid is tempered glass that has the characteristics of high temperature resistance and explosion-proof . It is non-toxic and easy to clean. For housewives, the most practical is that the lid with a wooden handle can stand on the table, this helps to save space and safe to touch. And the transparent lid let you to keep an eye over the food you are cooking. Good Gift: This flat bottom wok is a great gift choice for cooking lovers. It is useful for cooking various of Asian cuisine and the quality is very sturdy and durable. In addition, the free spatula and pasta serve are also small tools that are often used in cooking. And the package of this wok pan is very good, no additional package is needed if used as a gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VxbPuoqPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoank","source_asin":"B094CK9MTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-655715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094CK9MTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094CK9MTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
