window.products.push({"id":655877,"name":"Dish Drying Mat for Kitchen Counter Decor 18x24 Inch Absorbent Reversible Wild Plant Dish Mat Microfiber Drying Pad Gold Marble Dish Drainer Rack Mats","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s2yyTSetL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌸Super Absorbent: Both Sides Of The Dish Drying Mat Are Crafted With Durable Microfiber, Which Can Hold Up To 4 Times Its Weight In Water. Our Drying Mat Will Suck Up All The Leftover Wetness From Your Dishes, Glasses, Silverware, Pans, Pots, Fruits And Vegetables. Use Alone Or Pair With A Dish Drying Rack. Keep Your Kitchen Counter Dry And Clean. 🌸Perfect Size & Design:Our Kitchen Drying Mats Large Size 18\" X 24\" X 0.2\"(Thickness) Fits Most Kitchen Counters. It Can Hold A Lot Of Pots And Pans And Other Kitchen Utensils.Gold Marble Design Make Drying Mat For Kitchen Counter Look Very Elegant.A Perfect Decoration In You Kitchen,Which Can Add A Sense Of Fashionable. 🌸Multiple Uses: The Kitchen Dish Drying Mat Is Soft And Durable, Also Can Be Used As Dish Mat, Cup Mat, Heat Resistant Mat, Pet Mat,Dish Rack Mat,Coffee Machine Mat. It Also Protects Under Small Appliances Such As A Coffee Maker, Mixer, Or Blender On Kitchen Countertops To Prevent Scratches And Abrasion. Machine Washable And Tumble Dry Low. Ideal Gift For Housewarming Parties, Weddings, Welcome Home Presents, Etc. 🌸Fast Drying & Easy Storage Mat: The Dish Drying Mat Dries Quickly, So As Soon As Your Dishes Or Cookware Is Finished Drying, It Can Be Hanged Up With The Hanging Loop, Or Folded Up And Stored In Any Drawer, Cabinet, Or Closet. 🌸Lovely Home Gift:Features Vibrant Colors And Exquisite Image, That Will Surprise Your Family And Friends, Make A Perfect Housewarming Gift For New Home Or Renovation, Christmas, Mother’s Day, Birthday, Thanksgiving Etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s2yyTSetL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"antkondnm","source_asin":"B0B4K5DCJY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-655877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4K5DCJY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4K5DCJY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
