window.products.push({"id":655879,"name":"Mission Del Rey Native American Halo Warbonnet Headdress (H1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ASw3OjJVL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is an authentic Native American Navajo headdress. This decorative halo warbonnet style head dress is beautifully hand made with real feathers. Warbonnets are no doubt one of the most popular Native American icons from American Indian history. Used by various Plains Indian Tribes, the most notable being the Sioux, Crow, Blackfeet and Cheyenne. Native warbonnets often appear in historic photography as being reserved for formal occasions.   The halo style warbonnet has feathers that fan out around the head of the wearer creating the halo shape. This head dress was created with soft deer skin leather and is adorned with a band of hand stitched beading across the forehead. The beading, along with the horse hair fringe, quill and plume feathers, add to the rich and vibrant look of the head dress. This beautifully handcrafted war bonnet headdress will look great on any wall for southwest, western, or cabin decor. Picture is representative. Beading pattern may vary. Measures approximately 32\" tall, 30\" wide. (Wall bracket sold separately, see ASIN: B01AR1TW2S)   Authentic Native American, Tribe: Navajo","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ASw3OjJVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mission Del Rey","source_asin":"B01AQUL12Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-655879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AQUL12Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AQUL12Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
