window.products.push({"id":655905,"name":"Japanese Tamagoyaki Omelette Pan with Wide Silicone Spatula - Cast Iron Pre-Seasoned Traditional Rectangular Frying Pan with Wooden Handle for Square ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rKINreh3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MATERIAL - Cast iron with moulded wooden handle plus wide silicone spatulaPAN SIZE - 14.75 inches with handle. The pan itself is 7.5 inches long by 6 inches wide WEIGHT -2.5 lbs NOT JUST ANOTHER FRYING PAN - Your tamagoyaki pan is a unique, classic piece of Japanese cast iron cookware that you can proudly display in your kitchen. A traditional makiyakinabe in your kitchen tells everyone that you know and care about the way you prepare and serve special meals to your family and friends DO NOT BE CONFUSED - You know the chemical nonstick on light-weight aluminium or pressed metal tamayaki omlette pans will not last. These light weight skillets will never give you the steady, reliable heat you need for your expert cooking A NATURAL NON-STICK COATING - Your tamogayaki egg roll pan has a pure vegetable oil coating baked into the surface. As you use the pan this seasoning gets stronger and stronger over time providing performance equal to chemical non-stick pans EASILY REPAIRED SEASONING - Easily repair the seasoning layer on your pan if damaged. Something you cannot do with with chemical non-stick coated pans. Simple repair instructions are included with your pan ELEGANT WOODEN HANDLE - Moulded to fit tightly into the pan body the handle cannot move or twist on the pan. You get a safe and comfortable grip while keeping your hands well away from the heat NOT JUST OMELETTES - You can also make many other Japanese dishes as well as great grilled cheese sandwiches, steaks, hamburgers, bacon and eggs FULL Assurance - You are fully covered by our no questions asked, 100 Percent MONEY BACK Assurance ADD THIS UNIQUE PAN TO YOUR CART NOW. DELIVERY IS BY PRIME","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rKINreh3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ozeshow","source_asin":"B0915FVN77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-655905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0915FVN77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0915FVN77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":655906,"name":"OFFSIR Oil Sprayer for Cooking, Olive Oil Dispenser Bottle Spritzer Mister with 4 Replaceable Nozzles & Oil Brush for Air Fryer, BBQ, Kitchen Baking, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R0d75aimL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥑【Elevate Your Cooking Game】: OFFSIR Oil Sprayer is the perfect tool to take your cooking to the next level. Use it to spray oil on your frying pan or air fryer to prevent food from sticking, or spritz your BBQ, chicken, or favorite side dish with oil to add a burst of flavor. 🥦【Multipurpose Spray Bottle】: Our oil sprayer is versatile and can be filled with olive oil, vinegar, lemon juice, water, wine, and more. It produces a uniform mist, making it convenient for BBQ, air fryer, salad, baking, frying, grilling, and more. The possibilities are endless! 🍅【Our upgraded nozzle can be rotated to produce different spray effects. Press quickly for a foggy effect or slowly for a columnar effect. Note that the mist effect may vary depending on the distance and consistency of the liquid you fill it with. 🫒【Complete Oil Spray Set】: Our Oil Dispenser comes with a plastic bottle spray can, 4 replaceable atomizing spray heads, and an oil brush. This perfect combination of tools will meet all your needs. The attached brush makes it even more convenient to apply food. 🥜【Tips for Optimal Use】: To achieve the best mist, we recommend holding the sprayer a little higher when using oil. Also, avoid pouring thick liquids into it to prevent the nozzle from getting blocked. Use the included cotton brush to clean it manually.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R0d75aimL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OFFSIR","source_asin":"B0BJZ3X5JT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-655906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJZ3X5JT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJZ3X5JT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
